---
import Soga from "../../assets/images/soga_tres_nudos.webp";
---

<section class="bg-primary h-svh">
  <div class="text-white container mx-auto grid place-items-center h-full px-6">
    <div
      class="text-center items-center text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl leading-relaxed border-2 border-white p-8 md:p-18 h-[90%] w-full flex gap-5 flex-col justify-center card"
      id="welcome-text"
    >
      <p>
        No somos dos personas que decidieron <span class="italic font-bold"
          >caminar juntas</span
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        Somos tres hilos <span class="italic font-bold"
          >entrelazados por Dios</span
        > para formar un cordón que el tiempo <span class="italic font-bold"
          >no podrá romper.</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <img src={Soga.src} alt="Soga" class="w-64 md:w-80 self-center">
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #welcome-text {
    border-radius: 50px;
    corner-shape: scoop;
  }
</style>
